From: ViKing <viking.yfy@qq.com>
Subject: [PATCH] net: ethernet: qualcomm: ppe: expose flow and failure counters

Expose compact flow identities, live hardware hit counters, active-
flow totals and CPU/drop reasons through read-only debugfs. Keep
register dependency snapshots out of the normal driver diagnostics.

Signed-off-by: ViKing <viking.yfy@qq.com>
